{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01XVrsEPSboav712GvqgLQyr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntiers:\n  best:\n    meaning: \"GRPO recovery成功且放大了RASP的post-prune优势；CKA correlation显著；α ablation呈现可解释的最优曲线\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"GRPO v7（或后续修复）在RASP-pruned模型上成功训练，accuracy显著超过SFT-only baseline\"\n      - \"GRPO在Standard-pruned模型上恢复效果明显弱于RASP，形成recovery amplification效应\"\n      - \"post-prune 4pp gap（31% vs 27%）在N=1319 full eval和5-seed下统计显著\"\n      - \"mixed-effects regression中CKA β显著（p<0.001），在控制weight norm/gradient/activation后仍解释>15%方差\"\n      - \"α ablation呈现清晰单峰或可解释的非单调曲线，最优α下post-prune accuracy显著优于α=0（importance-only）\"\n      - \"GRASPrune+GRPO恢复效果显著低于RASP+GRPO，排除'recovery只反映post-prune accuracy'的混淆\"\n      - \"OOD eval（MATH-500, HumanEval）上RASP recovery优势迁移\"\n    number_ranges:\n      postprune_gsm8k_rasp_1319: [0.29, 0.34]\n      postprune_gsm8k_standard_1319: [0.24, 0.28]\n      postprune_gap_pp: [4, 8]\n      postprune_gap_p_value_5seed: [0.0001, 0.005]\n      post_grpo_gsm8k_rasp: [0.65, 0.75]\n      post_grpo_gsm8k_standard: [0.48, 0.58]\n      grpo_recovery_gap_pp: [12, 22]\n      post_sft_only_gsm8k_rasp: [0.55, 0.60]\n      post_sft_only_gsm8k_standard: [0.62, 0.67]\n      sft_vs_grpo_interaction_significant: true\n      cka_mixed_effects_beta_p: [0.0001, 0.001]\n      cka_incremental_r2: [0.15, 0.28]\n      alpha_optimal_vs_alpha0_gap_pp: [8, 15]\n      grasp_post_grpo_gsm8k: [0.30, 0.45]\n      inference_speedup_ratio: [1.22, 1.35]\n      ood_math500_rasp_advantage_pp: [5, 15]\n      unstructured_20_post_grpo: [0.55, 0.65]\n    narrative_direction: >\n      原始framing的Recovery Amplification版本：post-prune差异虽小（4-8pp），\n      但GRPO将其放大为不可逆的recovery gap（12-22pp）。Redundancy Paradox成立——\n      功能冗余结构被剪掉后RLVR可以重新分配其功能，功能独特结构一旦丢失无法恢复。\n      三个claims全部成立但Claim 1需从\"29x advantage\"修正为\"recovery amplification\"。\n      GRASPrune对比和OOD eval提供双重验证。α作为实用调参贡献。\n      竞争力：EMNLP Main强投稿，Efficient Methods track自然fit。\n\n  median:\n    meaning: \"GRPO有效但RASP vs Standard的recovery差距有限（<8pp）；CKA correlation中等显著；需pivot到α优化和pruning-recovery交互作为核心贡献\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"GRPO在两种pruned模型上都有一定恢复效果（超过SFT 3-10pp），但RASP vs Standard差距不大\"\n      - \"post-prune 4pp gap在full eval下显著，但5-seed方差较大（某些seed gap<2pp）\"\n      - \"CKA β显著但effect size中等（p<0.05，incremental R² 5-12%），部分被weight norm共线性解释\"\n      - \"α ablation有效——最优α明显优于α=0，但曲线噪声较多，最优点依赖random seed\"\n      - \"GRASPrune post-prune远差于RASP（8% vs 31%），但GRASPrune+GRPO缩小差距\"\n      - \"SFT-only对比证实交互效应存在：Standard在SFT下更好，RASP在GRPO下更好（或持平）\"\n      - \"OOD eval结果mixed——MATH-500上有优势，HumanEval上无差异\"\n    number_ranges:\n      postprune_gsm8k_rasp_1319: [0.28, 0.32]\n      postprune_gsm8k_standard_1319: [0.26, 0.30]\n      postprune_gap_pp: [1, 4]\n      postprune_gap_p_value_5seed: [0.01, 0.08]\n      post_grpo_gsm8k_rasp: [0.60, 0.68]\n      post_grpo_gsm8k_standard: [0.56, 0.64]\n      grpo_recovery_gap_pp: [2, 8]\n      post_sft_only_gsm8k_rasp: [0.54, 0.60]\n      post_sft_only_gsm8k_standard: [0.61, 0.67]\n      sft_vs_grpo_interaction_significant: true\n      cka_mixed_effects_beta_p: [0.005, 0.05]\n      cka_incremental_r2: [0.05, 0.12]\n      alpha_optimal_vs_alpha0_gap_pp: [5, 10]\n      grasp_post_grpo_gsm8k: [0.45, 0.58]\n      inference_speedup_ratio: [1.15, 1.25]\n      ood_math500_rasp_advantage_pp: [0, 8]\n      unstructured_20_post_grpo: [0.58, 0.66]\n    narrative_direction: >\n      Pivot到\"Pruning-Recovery Interaction\"：核心贡献从\"RASP enables recovery\"\n      转为\"pruning method和recovery method之间存在非trivial交互——\n      RLVR和SFT对pruned结构的需求不同\"。Claim 1弱化为\"CKA-aware pruning在GRPO recovery下\n      有中等优势\"；Claim 2保留但降低强度（\"CKA provides additional predictive signal\"\n      而非\"stronger predictor\"）；Claim 3成为最强claim——SFT倾向Standard、GRPO倾向RASP\n      的交叉效应是genuinely novel发现。α优化作为second practical contribution。\n      需要30% sparsity数据展示趋势。\n      竞争力：EMNLP Main有竞争力但需要强writing，Findings高概率。\n\n  worst:\n    meaning: \"GRPO未能提供超过SFT的恢复优势，或RASP在GRPO下无优势甚至劣于Standard；CKA correlation弱；原始三个claims均需重写\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"GRPO对pruned模型的恢复效果不稳定——accuracy未显著超过SFT baseline，或训练不收敛\"\n      - \"post-prune gap在5-seed下不显著（p>0.1），4pp差异在seed方差范围内\"\n      - \"CKA β不显著或incremental R²<3%，functional overlap对recoverability无实质预测力\"\n      - \"SFT recovery中Standard持续优于RASP（64% vs 57%已观测），GRPO未能逆转这一趋势\"\n      - \"α ablation有效（α=4.0确实最优），但这本质上是importance scaling，与CKA的理论联系薄弱\"\n      - \"GRASPrune虽然post-prune差（8%），但SFT恢复后差距大幅缩小\"\n      - \"OOD eval无差异或RASP劣势，Standard的SFT recovery可能是pattern memorization但RASP也不例外\"\n    number_ranges:\n      postprune_gsm8k_rasp_1319: [0.27, 0.32]\n      postprune_gsm8k_standard_1319: [0.27, 0.31]\n      postprune_gap_pp: [-1, 3]\n      postprune_gap_p_value_5seed: [0.08, 0.40]\n      post_grpo_gsm8k_rasp: [0.55, 0.63]\n      post_grpo_gsm8k_standard: [0.57, 0.66]\n      grpo_recovery_gap_pp: [-5, 2]\n      post_sft_only_gsm8k_rasp: [0.53, 0.59]\n      post_sft_only_gsm8k_standard: [0.61, 0.67]\n      sft_vs_grpo_interaction_significant: false\n      cka_mixed_effects_beta_p: [0.06, 0.50]\n      cka_incremental_r2: [0.00, 0.04]\n      alpha_optimal_vs_alpha0_gap_pp: [5, 12]\n      grasp_post_grpo_gsm8k: [0.50, 0.62]\n      inference_speedup_ratio: [1.08, 1.18]\n      ood_math500_rasp_advantage_pp: [-5, 3]\n      unstructured_20_post_grpo: [0.60, 0.68]\n    narrative_direction: >\n      完全reframe为\"Do Reasoning LLMs Need Recovery-Aware Pruning?\"——\n      一篇controlled empirical study，核心发现是surprising negative result：\n      (1) 在moderate sparsity下，CKA functional overlap不预测RLVR recoverability，\n      挑战了recovery-aware pruning的直觉假设；\n      (2) 但α-scaled importance scoring（与CKA无关的部分）确实优于vanilla magnitude pruning，\n      贡献一个简单有效的pruning scoring改进；\n      (3) SFT recovery对所有pruning方法都surprisingly effective，\n      暗示recovery robustness更多来自training signal而非pruning structure——\n      这与\"RL Squeezes, SFT Expands\"形成interesting tension。\n      GRASPrune全套对比+5-seed+多sparsity+OOD的实验thoroughness本身是卖点。\n      Negative result论文在EMNLP有precedent但需要：(a)假设足够reasonable让negative有价值，\n      (b)实验足够thorough让negative可信，(c)至少一个positive takeaway（α scoring）。\n      竞争力：EMNLP Main需要exceptional writing和reviewer运气，\n      但completeness of experiments和timeliness of topic（reasoning model compression）是优势。\n      Findings概率较高。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12420,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12420},"output_tokens":18,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b0f924e7-66b5-4573-a379-e22e31fd2447","uuid":"f1c50a72-9f3a-4a47-8361-9f986f4ab679"}
